Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:48.53,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神探飞机头》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！做得好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up! Good defense!Good defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,（玻璃 小心轻放）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进城去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 笨狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the hell up, you stupid mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,HDS公司送包裹 是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}HDS, sir. How are you this afternoon? Alrighty. I have a package for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但相信一定是好货色！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely. I'll bet it was something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是保险赔偿表格\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an insurance form.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请在这儿签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll just sign here, here, and here…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的表格会尽速送上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll get the rest of the forms to you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱的狗 我可以摸摸它吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lovely dog.Do you mind if I pet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.76,0:02:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a rat's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老弟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了 剩下的由我填吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine. I can finish the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just have yourself a good day. Take care now. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 HDS\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me! HDS!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一让 我可拿着个包裹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}HDS! Coming through!Got a package, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你守着门干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事？滚开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you? I said, get!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,（你中计了）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,（宠物侦探王牌威龙留）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.10,0:03:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:03:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是险过剃头啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛中总有失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every contest there must be a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,失…败…者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loohooserrhher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿吗？伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry, fellow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,自便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 火花塞湿了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. It gets flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需稍等一下就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just wait a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者现在就试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we can try it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚下车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑蛋总是无处不在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assholes are closer than they appear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我推一把！老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a push while you're back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.36,0:04:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alrighty, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,（失踪西施狗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,（发现即电王牌威龙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 过来 挂念妈妈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little baby, come here. You missed Mommy, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你爸爸有否伤害你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did. Did Daddy hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他那样做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let him. No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可保留那电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can keep the big TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's not gonna hurt my baby, no he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该如何报答你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I ever repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,付酬劳即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reward would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车有点损坏 又要加汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is some damage to my car, and I had to fill it with premium.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否替你脱裤子代替付款？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like for me to take your pants off instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee! Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这区的人可真友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are real friendly around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,（没空调的海边房子 出租中）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ventura!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 撒旦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 单从声音认不出你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir. You sounded like someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 王牌威龙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind the wisecracks, Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠租很久了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说过欠你的钱会优先处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Shickadance, I told you, you're my first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正插手一宗大案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a very big case right now. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一只白蚀鸽\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a true albino pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,富翁的 悬赏二万五千的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some rich guy lost it. He's offering a $25, 000 reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到这鸟就还你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I find this bird…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到这儿有动物叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard animals in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早又听到它们四处抓东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard them again this morning, scratching around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不把工作带回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never bring my work home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些狗粮又是什么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this pet food for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃多点纤维高的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要进来看看？来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna take a look inside? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.55,0:09:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Snoop around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,满意了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别让我捉到你带动物回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't let me catch you with an animal in here. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 保重 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.Take care, now. Bye-bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 森林之友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, jungle friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰 我问你们一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, let me ask you one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条五万磅重的鱼怎会不见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in hell do you lose a 500-pound fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我想说那不是鱼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I was just going to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是哺乳类动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's not a fish. It's a mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 科学家小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Jacques Cousteau.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无恶意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't mean anything by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不担心那鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a good goddamn about that fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢 可拿它做鱼柳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fillet it and fast-food it if you want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想赢超级杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I give a damn about is winning the Super Bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想胜利 至少要令球员安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My athletes have got to have their heads in the right place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已入这行那么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, Roger! You've been in this business a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那些球员是多迷信！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how superstitious these players are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中后那四分卫便把袜子倒穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a quarterback that's put his socks on backwards since high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后卫两年没洗过护阴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a linebacker that hasn't washed his jockey strap in two years…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他认为苍蝇能带来好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he thinks flies are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要那条鱼在大赛日登场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that fish on that field Super Bowl Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻回那条鱼或是另找新差事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the fish…or find new jobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要选这时候？大赛两周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did it happen now, two weeks before the Super Bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是动物权益组织的人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, it's those animal-rights activists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是高举他们的标语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always out with their signs:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「动物生而自由 别虐待雪花」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Animals were born free! Stop torturing Snowflake!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条鱼的生活比我们都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fish lives better than they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰 警方现在已经着手调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police are checking into the animal-rights groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方对这件事 有回音吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have they called back?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但我想告诉你 我的「可图」走失时\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I wanted to tell you, when I lost my Cuddles…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请了宠物侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired a pet detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,请什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠物侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pet detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 但还是交给专业人士做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Martha, but we better leave this to professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相当不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, he was quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦查宠物是一门深奥的学问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pet detection is a very involved, highly scientific process.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.64,0:13:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如穿手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ventura here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 我是玛莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, Martha. - Hi, I'm Melissa Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来时有麻烦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any trouble getting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 戴胶手套的人很温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the guy with the rubber glove was surprisingly gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大赛一周前 保安很严格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security's tight Super Bowl week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐 我开门见山说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have a seat? I'll get right to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.31,0:14:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我们的吉祥物被盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mascot was stolen from his tank last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是什么来的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you familiar with Snowflake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从迈哈密海洋馆得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him from Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罕有的长鼻海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a rare bottle-nosed dolphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是它在半场休息时的新表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a new trick he was going to do for the halftime show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.99,0:14:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！海豚 我们开始吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚 再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好傢伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要烟灰缸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like an ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.26,0:15:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不吸烟 很讨人厌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't smoke.It's a disgusting habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方今天来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police came today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显绑匪从后门进来 像是用…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, the kidnappers came in through the back with a…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,四轮传动 开背式的客货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four-wheel-drive van, loaded from the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚失踪有否带来麻烦 罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, how you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我被炒鱿鱼时面呈怪相…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm walking funny it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为要应付太多记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I got two dozen reporters up my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们整天问我雪花的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been asking me about Snowflake all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是普罗杰 这是威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger Podacter, meet Ace Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我聘请的宠物侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our pet detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 梅玛莎小姐极推荐你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you. You came very highly recommended by Martha Mertz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅玛莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha Mertz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 那条母狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, the bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waht?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,北京狗 在高原公园失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pekingese, lost in Highland Park area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到它时半死不活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was half-dead when I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.28,0:15:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是水池吗？失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the tank?Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警方放干的？- 是 今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cops drain it? - Yes, this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我五分钟内不回来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not back in five minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那再多等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}just wait longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长日志 星际日期23.9\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's log, stardate 23.9, rounded off to the nearest decimal point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重回过去 拯救一古生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've traveled back in time to save an ancient species from annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前尚没海洋生物痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far…no signs of aquatic life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无论如何 我定要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am going to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能 再替宇宙其它的分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to tear another black hole,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我要去找它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会出去阻止他们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to head them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, get out of the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't do it, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已没能量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, get out of the tank now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个医生 不是洗池工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, Jim, I'm a doctor, not a pool man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个医生 不是洗池工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor, not a pool man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪花在何处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Snowflake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不能与大家见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowflake is not available right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都等了一整天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, I've been waiting all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要拍到它的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get a shot of his new trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是否病了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, is he sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉茜一定是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lassie must be missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有否侦破大案件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make any good collars lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还扔是普通案件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or were they leashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀案 威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homicide, Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算如何侦破此案？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna solve that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.86,0:18:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question, Aguado!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.07,0:19:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我会先找出犯案动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I'd establish a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子 凶手因妒死者老二太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer saw the size of the bug's dick and became insanely jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 你会慰籍凶手太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd lose 30 pounds porking his wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深一吻 请求原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, kiss and make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我有问题问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.I'd like to ass you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是合适的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the time, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果艾路丝下来看见 我便死定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Einhorn come down here and see me talking to you or your ass, I'm history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.74,0:19:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必需告诉我雪花一案谁负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep him under control. You have to tell me who's on the Snowflake case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你 太多限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do nothing for you on that. My hands are tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到我问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it! Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需五分钟独处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes alone, that's all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快装得很忙样子 艾下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better look alive. Einhorn's on her way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now. Ace, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:20:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 怕我放屁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that matter? Afraid I'll make a stink? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓜多负责那案的 这下行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aguado's working the case, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓜多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aguado!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good call!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我们现在很忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just a little busy now…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有命案 劫案和毒犯要应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}with murderers and burglaries and drug dealers. Things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚失踪不算是大案\N{\fnArial\fs30}A missing dolphin isn't exactly a high priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你令他生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you've pissed him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饶了我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you give me a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再控制他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold him much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上司来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boss is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已查过动物权益组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ran a check with local animal-rights groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也查过标本店和租车公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked out the taxidermists and we already checked on van rentals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止 仍没有线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, nothing, nathin', nada. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有不寻常的外围投注？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any unusual bets being made?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有 这是超级杯嘛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course! This is Super Bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那水池有何发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you find out about the tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些轮迹 逃走路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tire tracks, an escape route.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个什么也没看见的守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guard didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.95,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只此而已？- 我看是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 趁我未惹上麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now will you please get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:20:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I get in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的合作 另外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your cooperation.By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有薄荷糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have a mint?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,奸人糖呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps some Binaca?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy testicle Tuesday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎会在此的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是刺杀肯尼迪的另一枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the second gunman on the grassy knoll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.33,0:21:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话 我知你在查雪花一案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me the routine. I know you're working the Snowflake case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你把它交由专家处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I suggest you yield to the experts on this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到这海猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find the porpoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:22:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深感如释重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那或许无补于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, that might not do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人失去海猪 被偷的是海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's missing a porpoise. It's a dolphin that's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.15,0:22:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通海猪是大牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The common harbor porpoise has an abrupt snout…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而长鼻海豚是圆尖齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the bottle-nosed dolphin, or Tursiops truncatus…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是两种截然不同的牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}has an elongated beak, cone-shaped teeth and a serrated dorsal appendage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你已全知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sure you already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.97,0:22:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我心动的便是这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what turns me on about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是观察入微\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your attention to detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听着 宠物鸡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pet dick…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要我把你的生活变成炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}how would you like me to make your life a living hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是真的想和你谈恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not really ready for a relationship, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谢谢你提出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank you for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许改天给你电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll give you a call sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话仍是911？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your number still 911?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 格雷在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Is Greg here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the password?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.23,0:24:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,新英格兰鱼汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}New England clam chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.73,0:24:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤是红色的还是白色的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the red or the white?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,白色\N{\fnArial\fs30}White?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.61,0:24:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡士托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Woodstock!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.08,0:24:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣方济 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Saint Francis, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 谢谢关心 希望你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super, thanks for asking. I hope you're having a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有假的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.52,0:24:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？猛丁哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是看鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watching the fishies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.19,0:24:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见那些吗？那是挪威捕鲸队\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see those blips? That's a Norwegian whaling fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.60,0:24:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发给他们新的方位座标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending them new directional coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.37,0:24:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会找到屈原\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll find Jimmy Hoffa…before they find any whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.61,0:24:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妙 你可否进入…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravy! So can you still tap into.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋物品买卖资料库？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the aquatic supply stores in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I can. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.91,0:24:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看近日…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna trace the sale of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.81,0:24:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,购入运送海豚装置记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}equipment for transporting or housing a dolphin recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.45,0:24:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为有什么挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I thought you had a challenge for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:25:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋绳索 二万加仑的大鱼缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we got marine winch, sling, feeder fish, 20, 000-gallon tank…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.73,0:25:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个平民来说 真不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of equipment for a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.47,0:25:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！可是个百万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Camp? The billionaire?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,亦是罕有鱼类收藏家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billionaire and rare-fish collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.14,0:25:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.38,0:25:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便是敌人真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the face of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,老想染指濒临绝种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always trying to get his greedy hands on endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他与海豚队有关连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.Camp is connected with the dolphins?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.12,0:25:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 天才 捐地建球场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That subgenius gave them the land the stadium's built on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.39,0:25:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他又举行「出风头」派对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look, he's throwing another "I'm the richest man in the universe" party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.00,0:25:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎是找个舞伴的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's time for me to get myself a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这次可算是冒大险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really going out on a limb here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.54,0:25:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘氏派对请的全是名流\N{\fnArial\fs30}His social events are strictly A-list.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.31,0:25:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会开始时搞得很好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The date started good, Chuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.35,0:25:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但抵达派对前她脚软\N{\fnArial\fs30}but before we got to the party, she tensed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你给我带来麻烦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do anything to embarrass me…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.15,0:26:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 像这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 史塔宾队长 霍华和德好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Captain Stubing.How are Gopher and Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.83,0:26:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求登舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to come aboard, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！朗恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很美 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look wonderful. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.30,0:26:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？你朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is he, a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.94,0:26:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是我的…我的舞伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is… This is my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:26:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.11,0:27:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有名字的吗？还是要我叫他「律师先生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have a name, or should I call him "Lawyer"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.92,0:27:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 他叫…王牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. This is Ace V…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.55,0:27:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆·王牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.26,0:27:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 也恭贺你今晚的成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you.Congratulations on all your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.89,0:27:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的气味真是一流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.20,0:27:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚和玛莉莎说我们在大学就有一门…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the first lessons we learned back at…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.10,0:27:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门研究食物毒害富人官司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanford was the growth of food- poisoning claims against wealthy-people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.34,0:27:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只这一门就可以开专门律师行\N{\fnArial\fs30}One could make quite a lucrative law practice with little else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚每个人觉得如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is everybody feeling tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.42,0:27:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常 非常好 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.29,0:27:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 那儿有法式小点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, honey…there's the hors d'oeuvres.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.86,0:27:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？雪花不会是甘偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane? There is no way that Camp stole Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.03,0:27:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行动前想法缠着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you keep him occupied while I work my magic, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.65,0:28:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好吃 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooshy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.09,0:28:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎酒店送了数箱给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a few cases from my new dealer in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.13,0:28:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Ron…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.09,0:28:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to use the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是那些肝酱作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's the paste?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.54,0:28:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厕所在那边 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure, it's over there.- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西出来时定比进去时好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff probably looks better on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老早就已不大舒服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't feeling well earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.16,0:30:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.86,0:30:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,威龙来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace Ventura's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.03,0:30:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.62,0:31:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowflake!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.42,0:31:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.46,0:31:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a snack for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些鱼美丽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're wonderful, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.41,0:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they certainly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.18,0:31:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我遇上什么挫折…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what's going on in my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.48,0:31:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见它们便觉心平气和\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can always watch them swim and be totally at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.79,0:31:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是雪花！这不是雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Snowflake!It's not Snowflake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.82,0:32:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友不会有事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure your date is all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已去了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been an awfully long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.22,0:32:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.11,0:32:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.74,0:32:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别进去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.69,0:32:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我马上找水管匠来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'll have the plumbing checked immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 如果我喝了那厕所水便没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that! If I'd been drinking out of the toilet, I might've been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 王牌先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry again, Mr. Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.97,0:33:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.84,0:33:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.11,0:33:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他做什么？- 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he doing? - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.81,0:33:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.38,0:33:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不明白你的裤子去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even wanna know why your pants are missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.45,0:33:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能令我失业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've cost me my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.29,0:33:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你在雪花的水池找到石子 我马上打电话CNN\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you found a pebble in Snowflake's tank. I'll call CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.93,0:33:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水池找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it in the filter, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是石子 是罕有的橙宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not a pebble, it's a rare, triangular cut orange amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚 见甘的戒指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight I saw the same stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.11,0:33:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,镶有同样宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Camp's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.07,0:33:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过雪花不是他偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said Camp didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.28,0:33:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他戒指上的宝石仍在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, his ring wasn't missing a stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.15,0:33:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷海豚的人一定有同样的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whoever was in that tank had a ring just like his.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.25,0:33:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么戒指？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring? What ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,84年海豚队美国联盟冠军戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 1984 Dolphin AFC championship ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.99,0:33:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那戒指之人便可找到雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find the ring with a missing stone, I find Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.90,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.77,0:34:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.44,0:34:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.85,0:34:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不学好驾驶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you learn how to drive, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.88,0:34:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩玩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.03,0:34:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.67,0:36:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那宝石可能来自任何地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That stone could've come from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.14,0:36:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能来自项链或耳环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've come from a necklace or a pendant, an earring.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.21,0:37:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是84年美国联盟冠军戒指上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came from an '84 AFC championship ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.59,0:37:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾路丝组长认为是动物权益组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einhorn thinks it may have been an animal-rights group.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过FAN吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know FAN?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.02,0:37:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,富女简秋霞发起的解放动物会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free Animals Now, started by Chelsea, daughter of industrialist Fisher Gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.93,0:37:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球有超过五十万会员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over half a million members worldwide?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.30,0:37:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听过 他们是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.14,0:37:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去年发出127封恐吓信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要求各队放生吉祥物\N{\fnArial\fs30}they sent letters to college teams demanding the release of their mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.84,0:37:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用什么喂狗的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you feed your dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.41,0:37:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗粮 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog food. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.25,0:37:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is miserable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.68,0:37:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.85,0:37:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很不快乐 我为它难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very unhappy. I feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.19,0:37:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙食差 与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad diet, isolated environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.39,0:37:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的是它还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.42,0:37:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宝石原理行不通所以生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just mad because your stupid pebble theory didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.70,0:37:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愤怒难以宣泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't express anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.17,0:37:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你很丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? And you're ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.97,0:38:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不想和你谈话 走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even gonna talk to you. Would you please leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.24,0:38:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？让你可以打它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? So you can beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.34,0:38:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,肥妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.28,0:38:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真离谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.98,0:38:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,聘用你是个大错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiring you was the biggest mistake I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.15,0:38:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不大哭一场？大屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why don't you cry about it, saddlebags?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.15,0:38:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like her, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.77,0:38:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Melissa, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.54,0:38:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在北峰大厦外…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here at the North Beach Towers condo complex in north Miami…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.84,0:38:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队领队普罗杰自杀的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}where Roger Podacter, head of operations for the Miami Dolphins has apparently committed suicide…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.02,0:38:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是从二十多楼跳下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}allegedly leaping to his death from his 20th-story balcony…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.96,0:39:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.87,0:39:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说过 当时我在家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. I was in my apartment across the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.20,0:39:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard a scream…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是通知大厦经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I called the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.04,0:39:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿除了狗 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place was empty, except for the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.58,0:39:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打开阳台我们看出去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I opened the balcony door and looked out…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.38,0:39:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,便见那一滩血饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}splat, bang, pancake time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.85,0:39:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.19,0:39:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很不安 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a bad night?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.07,0:39:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物能嗅到邪恶的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So animals can sense evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.88,0:39:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让这兽医进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who let Dr. Doolittle in?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.68,0:39:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟麦小姐一起到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, he came with Miss Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.65,0:39:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是警方的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is police business.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.52,0:39:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸时找到血及虫才通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let you know if the coroner finds a tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.45,0:39:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face it…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.49,0:40:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是对的 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. She's right.Besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.99,0:40:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想人指出我的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't want someone tracing my steps, pointing out my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.25,0:40:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为这是自杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…you don't think this is an obvious suicide, Mr. Pet Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.02,0:40:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.29,0:40:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因没有证据支持这观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of evidence here to support your theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.66,0:40:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了 那扶手上的血渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except, of course, for that spot of blood on the railing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.96,0:40:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉你我的想法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I tell you what I think happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.93,0:40:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,普罗杰下班后喝过几杯便回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger Podacter went out after work, had a few drinks, then came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.57,0:40:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不是单独一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.87,0:40:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他们发生争执 他被人扔下阳台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else was with him. There was a struggle…and he was thrown over that balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,普罗杰不是自杀 是被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger Podacter didn't commit suicide.He was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.85,0:41:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个很有趣的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very entertaining story…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.25,0:41:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真正侦探一切讲求证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}but real detectives have to worry about that little thing called evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.53,0:41:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到有人冲厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I heard a toilet flush.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.10,0:41:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者有海龟已走失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe somebody lost a turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.17,0:41:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我已技穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I…I guess I'm out of my league here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.44,0:41:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.62,0:41:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is just one more thing, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.19,0:41:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女人住在对面单位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman is Roger Podacter's neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.23,0:41:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说听到尖叫声 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said she heard a scream. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.50,0:41:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.03,0:41:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你说进来时要打开阳台的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you had to open the balcony door when you came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.43,0:41:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是真的 - 你肯定要打开这门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's true. - You're sure you had to open this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.64,0:41:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.17,0:41:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想证明什么？威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point, Ventura?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.84,0:41:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想证明一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.72,0:42:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是双重隔音玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is double-paned, soundproof glass. There is no way…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,邻居是无法听到普的尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}she could have heard Podacter scream on the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.93,0:42:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她听到的尖叫是来自这室内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scream she heard came from inside…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.50,0:42:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被扔出阳台之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he was thrown off the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手离开前关上这门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The murderer closed the door upon going.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.91,0:42:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel that, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.80,0:42:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已驱走恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have exorcized the demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.58,0:42:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这屋子安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.85,0:42:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全是失败者 - 赶他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Losers. - Get him out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.16,0:42:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,回动物园去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事与雪花被盗有关连\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing is connected, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.31,0:43:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到那戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to find that other ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.61,0:43:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已查过所有的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, you checked all the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.08,0:43:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,收据呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receipts? What about receipts?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.42,0:43:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.15,0:43:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,（1990年足总物资）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.19,0:43:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才的表现很出色\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pretty impressive, what you did at the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.40,0:43:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无需告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很了解自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.14,0:43:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你该做个真正的侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should've joined the police force, become a real detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.18,0:43:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做与人类有关的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很爱动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really love animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.65,0:43:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果天气够冷的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it gets cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.52,0:43:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实和他们有亲戚关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I have a kinship with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.39,0:43:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.89,0:43:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否要听怪异故事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna hear something spooky?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.00,0:44:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十二岁那年做了个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time when I was about 12, I had a dream that I was being followed by…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.77,0:44:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被一只疯狗跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}a big dog with rabies.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.61,0:44:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他双眼血红 口吐白沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had these bloodshot eyes…and foam came out of his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.91,0:44:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我跑多快 它也越来越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how fast I ran, he just kept gaining on me and gaining on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.22,0:44:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我走进家门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then just before I got to my front door…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.49,0:44:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跳了过来 咬着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he jumped and sank his teeth in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.79,0:44:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒了后 摸摸颈背\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I woke up…and felt the back of my neck. Check that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.70,0:44:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}you check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.33,0:44:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.04,0:44:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我情不自禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I just couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.71,0:44:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我为何干这行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know why I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.17,0:44:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道想不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.21,0:44:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.65,0:44:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你一旦了解我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}because once you get inside my head…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.38,0:44:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,便不会以我表面的作为来判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.79,0:45:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否全部收据都在此了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are these all? There's only a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.07,0:45:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许在后面另一档案内吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's in another file, in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.34,0:45:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是谁？- 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.84,0:45:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.41,0:45:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷费高 踢球员 你不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Ray Finkle, the kicker. Don't you know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.59,0:45:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为何不在这照片中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why isn't he in this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.79,0:45:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是较早前拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was taken earlier in the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.79,0:45:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在季中才加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Finkle wasn't added till mid-season.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.00,0:45:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那年他踢失了决定性的一球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He missed the final field goal in the Super Bowl that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.81,0:45:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,令海豚队得不到冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cost the Dolphins the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.98,0:45:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他有戒指 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he got himself a ring, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.48,0:45:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.01,0:45:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,新踢球员带来丰盛的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Replacement kicker having a great year."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.98,0:46:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明星踢球员扬言进军超级杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ready for Super Bowl, all-star kicker boasts."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.99,0:46:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,临门脚软 冠军泡汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Field goal sails wide, Dolphins lose Super Bowl."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.82,0:46:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,名闻天下的一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The kick heard round the world."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.69,0:46:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是说费高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Finkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.86,0:46:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队以一分输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dolphins lost by one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.03,0:46:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,（费高不获续约）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.13,0:46:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的傢伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.03,0:46:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有犯案动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor guy with a motive, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.84,0:46:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在何处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.71,0:46:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,回了家乡古利镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard he went back to his hometown in Collier County.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.68,0:46:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.35,0:46:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在起程前会送我回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna drop me off before you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.65,0:46:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 目前你不宜独居\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. You shouldn't be left alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.49,0:46:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家已不是安全之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be safe at your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.92,0:46:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何建议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.10,0:47:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.61,0:47:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已做了三次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.08,0:47:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 以前我未试过不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, that's never happened to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.45,0:47:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.75,0:47:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm ready again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.34,0:48:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,（古利镇 雷费狗的家乡）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.06,0:48:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,（废狗 不会踢球的笨蛋）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.00,0:48:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,（笨蛋…）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.00,0:48:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,（费高烂货）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.81,0:48:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找雷费高…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Ray Finkle…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.81,0:48:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一条新的内裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a clean pair of shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.95,0:48:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他有何认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about Ray Finkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.88,0:48:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,足球踢球员 七六年高中毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soccer-style kicker. Graduated from Collier High, 1976.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.09,0:48:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,80年大学毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stetson University honors graduate, 1980.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.52,0:48:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有两项NCAA记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holds two NCAA records.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.09,0:48:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,得分最多 踢得最远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most points and distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.86,0:48:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前绰号叫马子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nickname, "The Mule."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:49:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,此地的唯一职业运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only pro athlete from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.33,0:49:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是美国人模范之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one hell of a model American.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.84,0:49:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是新闻特写记者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you another one of them Hard Copy guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.61,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是他的球迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.I'm just a big Finkle fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿是我的圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my Graceland, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you put that gun down?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.62,0:49:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个球迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy is a fan of our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.36,0:49:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 我是费高的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice to meet you.I'm Ray's mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.93,0:49:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is Ray's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.50,0:49:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a real honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.17,0:49:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你的光临才是荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.60,0:49:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子很喜欢他的球迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Ray is so appreciative of his fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.67,0:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会很高兴你来探他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be so pleased you stopped by.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.48,0:49:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他随时会回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you expecting Ray anytime soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.74,0:49:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他随时回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. I expect him home any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.21,0:49:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃饼吗？刚做好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some cookies? I just baked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.82,0:49:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.76,0:50:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷费高之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Finkle's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.20,0:50:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迫不及待想见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.43,0:50:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray ain't coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.57,0:50:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太说他随时会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your wife expects him any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.67,0:50:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她无时无刻不在等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She expects him home any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.38,0:50:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？他是失控列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the engine's running but there's nobody behind the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.55,0:50:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.08,0:50:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们儿子从精神院逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}our son escaped from Shady Acres Mental Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.42,0:50:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在叫我拿回他的衣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're still bugging us to pick up his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.66,0:50:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是马理诺的错 人人皆知\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all that Dan Marino's fault. Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.60,0:50:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他持球时把车缝口向外\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he'd held the ball laces out, like he's supposed to…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高便不会踢失那球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray wouldn't have missed the kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.80,0:50:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马理诺该生梅毒死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan Marino should die of gonorrhea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.14,0:50:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,万劫不复\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rot in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.27,0:50:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃饼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a cookie, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.04,0:50:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天…全是小足球\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know?They're little footballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.88,0:51:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,缝口向外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laces out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.05,0:51:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等费高回来 再踢足球\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Ray gets back and starts kicking again…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.99,0:51:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至不会发觉他离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll never even know he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.59,0:51:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的房跟他离开时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've kept his room just the way he left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.00,0:51:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,（缝口向外 死马理诺）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.54,0:51:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,（马理诺13号）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.92,0:51:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！真狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.92,0:51:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,体育狂 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a sports nut, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.33,0:51:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗？- 请随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Oh, yes, by all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.04,0:51:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,十七届超级杯还有五秒便完场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five seconds to go here in Super Bowl 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.51,0:52:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队只落后49人队一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolphins trailing the 49ers…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.64,0:52:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这球将可助迈哈密取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}by one. This will win the game for Miami.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.55,0:52:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马理诺负责持球 踢出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marino holds.The kick…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.72,0:52:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,球飞得很高…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's high.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.65,0:52:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 过门不入\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's…no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.16,0:52:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷费高临门失机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Finkle blew a 26-yard field goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.23,0:52:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don 't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.86,0:52:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队输了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dolphins lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.37,0:52:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队输了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dolphins lose! The Dolphins lose the Super Bowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.34,0:52:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛莉莎是我 - 你在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Melissa, it's Ace! - Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.94,0:52:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在疯人村 马理诺在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in psychoville, and Finkle's the mayor. Where's Marino?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.81,0:52:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,马理诺 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.11,0:52:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能和雪花一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's about to join Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.71,0:52:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必需知道他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta know where he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.01,0:52:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去了保加片场拍广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a commercial shoot at the Bogart Sound Stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.42,0:52:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警 并加派保安进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the police. Get extra security over there. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.26,0:52:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？王牌！王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.63,0:52:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I left?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.40,0:52:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我真的走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really gonna go this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.07,0:53:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, folks. Very quiet.Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.38,0:53:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唐马理诺 深明保护之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dan Marino, and if anyone knows the value of protection, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.82,0:53:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我照顾这双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take care of the hands that take care of me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.56,0:53:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,采用伊苏东拿手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}with lsotoner gloves!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.06,0:53:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止 从头再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut! Again from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.20,0:53:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说停下来 - 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said, cut! - Guys, it's a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.17,0:53:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.90,0:53:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.31,0:53:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事 又改剧本吗？- 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this, a rewrite? - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.65,0:53:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们去那儿了？- 那边 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd they go? - Over there!Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.19,0:53:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.83,0:53:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠物侦探来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pet detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.30,0:54:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 打不中我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?Can't you hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.63,0:54:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有否要求赎金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have there been ransom demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.47,0:54:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑匪尚未跟我们联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no communication with the kidnappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.01,0:54:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级杯是否会延期举行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the Super Bowl be postponed?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,球赛如期举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is on as scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.04,0:54:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何没有雪花的消息公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why weren't we told about the kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.21,0:54:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保密理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrecy was essential. We couldn't risk any interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.32,0:54:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,两案是否有关连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the crimes related?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.55,0:54:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 暂无进一步评论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I can't comment further.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.69,0:54:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.76,0:55:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿普罗杰的验尸报告出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the autopsy on Podacter!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.96,0:55:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓜多 发张通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aguado, send out a memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.33,0:55:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不准向新闻界发表谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one talks to the press!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.43,0:55:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿杯咖啡给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somebody get me some coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.10,0:55:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的罪恶克星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight on Miami Vice,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.07,0:55:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,高杰给上司送咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crockett gets the boss a coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.54,0:55:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从洗手间出来前\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I get out of that bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.44,0:55:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd better be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.18,0:55:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是大便还是小便？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it number one or number two?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.54,0:55:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna know how much time I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.88,0:55:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何我已解开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I went ahead and solved that…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.79,0:55:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪花 普罗杰和马理诺之谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}pesky Snowflake-Podacter-Marino thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.62,0:55:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.02,0:55:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过雷费高这踢球员吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard of a former Dolphin kicker named Ray Finkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.17,0:55:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 长话短说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ventura…make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在雪花的池内找到一个宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a rare stone at the bottom of Snowflake's tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.11,0:55:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是84年美国联盟冠军戒指上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to a Dolphin '84 AFC championship ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.14,0:55:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那年费高踢失一球\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would've been a Super Bowl ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.85,0:55:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,输掉超级杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Ray missed the kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.45,0:55:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把责任推在马理诺身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blames the whole thing on Marino.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.58,0:56:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说的是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking paranoid, delusional psychosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.69,0:56:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过这人的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the guy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.59,0:56:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是吃人狂的话 会住得很舒适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cozy, if you're Hannibal Lecter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.72,0:56:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,与普罗杰又何关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how does Roger Podacter fit in?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.49,0:56:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信费高被普认出\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is, Finkle was snooping around. Podacter recognized him. End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.50,0:56:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于雪花 他用了费高的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for Snowflake, they gave him Finkle's number,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.90,0:56:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并学他踢球\N{\fnArial\fs30}taught him how to kick a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.30,0:56:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高认为是耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle took it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.51,0:56:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高现在何处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is Finkle now?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.54,0:56:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃离疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busted out of a mental institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.24,0:56:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已计划这次行动多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been plotting his revenge for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.05,0:56:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待时机向海豚队报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for the perfect time to get back at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.02,0:56:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最能打击海豚队的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time when it'd hurt them most:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.99,0:56:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是超级杯赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super Bowl time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.75,0:56:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 我已对正确生厌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I'm tired of being right!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.39,0:56:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.13,0:56:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done some fine detective work…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.84,0:56:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.64,0:56:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 请向着我未聋的耳说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, could you speak into my good ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.51,0:57:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎叫我王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard you call me Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.21,0:57:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我以前看错你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你不只是个宠物鸡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you are more than just a pet dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.16,0:57:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的枪压住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gun is digging into my hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.16,0:57:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？要否我宣独你的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?Want me to read you your rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.13,0:57:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者迟些吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.94,0:57:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那瘦骨婊子…玛莉莎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bony little bitch…Melissa Robinson?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.51,0:57:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会让我感到触电吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.11,0:57:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.45,0:57:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧 我听到声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay in here? I heard some commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.65,0:57:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.82,0:57:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要否我赶他走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to throw him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.12,0:57:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不自己滚出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you throw yourself out?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.69,0:57:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.17,0:57:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 把一切交给我们处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, I want you to leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.27,0:58:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我受聘找寻雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that, lieutenant. I was hired to find Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.77,0:58:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到马理诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we find Marino…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,便把雪花给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll deliver Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.04,0:58:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到雪花 把马理诺给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I find Snowflake…I'll deliver Marino.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.33,0:58:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉莎 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Melissa, it's Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.86,0:58:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来此干吗？半夜三更的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here? It's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.53,0:58:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必需弄我进疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to commit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.77,0:58:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高逃离后 仍有衣物在院中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle escaped from Shady Acres. They still have his stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.34,0:58:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会准我们四处看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't gonna let us look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.94,0:58:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 幸好我是伪装专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.It's a good thing I'm a master of disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.31,0:58:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗宾森小姐 我是韩医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Robinson…I'm Dr. Handly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.85,0:58:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我们看谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now who is it you want us to look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥 拉利\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother…Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.96,0:58:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,教练 我已很好 让我出场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to go in. Just give me a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.96,0:59:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这比赛很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know there's a lot riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.26,0:59:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是心理问题 向正面想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all psychological.Just gotta stay positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.84,0:59:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会施展战术…慢动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna execute a buttonhook pattern, super slow-mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在即时重播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see that in an instant replay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.65,1:00:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是这儿第一个足球员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother won't be the first football pro we've treated.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.16,1:00:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that right? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.29,1:00:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很关注运动员所受的压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very sensitive…to the stress athletes have to endure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.59,1:00:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在空位！没人防守！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm open! I'm open!I'm open!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.17,1:00:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会作初步评估的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do some preliminary evaluations…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.80,1:00:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他在此会很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think he'll fit in nicely here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.27,1:00:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.08,1:00:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,351！\N{\fnArial\fs30}351!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.49,1:00:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎无法忘记那比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to have some difficulty letting go of the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.02,1:00:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有精神病记录吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he had a history of mental illness?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.59,1:00:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我认识他便有\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I've known him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.26,1:00:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的一间治疗室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of our therapy rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.70,1:00:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这儿做手工艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we do arts and crafts out here in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.50,1:00:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是储物室 再下去还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the storage room. Down the hallway we have another…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.67,1:00:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,半场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halftime!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.12,1:01:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,廿分钟内他不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be fine there by himself for the next 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.60,1:01:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去看看宿舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you the dormitories, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.66,1:02:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.67,1:02:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊苏东拿手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isotoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.57,1:02:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,（去死 马理诺）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.15,1:02:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,（缝口向外）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.89,1:02:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,死心眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obsess much?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.53,1:02:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去那儿？- 清洁储物室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you going? - To clean the storage room.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.60,1:02:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先清洁小吃部\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, clean the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.83,1:03:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知如何告诉你…去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't tell you how to do your job.The schedule says…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.54,1:03:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知自己做什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.84,1:03:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该老早就已洗洁好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've done it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.87,1:03:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 我清洁这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, come on. Cafeteria, my ass! I'm cleaning in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.51,1:03:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休息得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take breaks too long. You smoke…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.15,1:03:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're a pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.17,1:03:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索失踪旅行者的行动已终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Search called off for missing hiker."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.24,1:03:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救者无法找到艾露丝的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A search ended today when rescue workers…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.21,1:03:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索行动今天结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}were unable to find the body of Lois Einhorn."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.15,1:03:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行者失踪？艾露丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hiker missing since Friday?Lois Einhorn?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.45,1:03:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shitballs!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.99,1:03:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shitballs!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.14,1:04:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么？回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing out here? Get back to work!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.80,1:04:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,（亲爱的露丝 谢谢赐与良宵…）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.77,1:04:42.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱你的罗杰？）\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Love, Roger?"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.78,1:04:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace, it's E.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.21,1:04:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你的发现很重要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the article you found was something?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.58,1:04:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到张普送给艾的纸条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a note from Roger to Einhorn…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.25,1:05:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢她赐与良宵\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanking her for a wonderful evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.96,1:05:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something ain 't stirring the Kool-Aid, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.69,1:05:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇尾 倒带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiggles, rewind.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.97,1:05:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾路丝和雷费高有何关连？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does Lois Einhorn have to do with Ray Finkle?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.94,1:05:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, think!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.84,1:05:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷和艾同谋此事？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle and Einhorn, in it together. How? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.92,1:05:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在那儿 用用脑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Here we go.Answer's right there! Just gotta get blood to the brain!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.59,1:05:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷费高和艾露丝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle and Einhorn! Finkle and Einhorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.73,1:05:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得努力想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle and Einhorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.83,1:05:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,费高和艾露丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finkle and Einhorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.04,1:05:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quitter!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.51,1:05:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.91,1:06:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已没食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any food for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.92,1:06:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要买食物必需有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to have money to buy food.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.85,1:06:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有钱必需有海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to have a dolphin to get money.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.69,1:06:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见这儿有海豚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see a dolphin here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.73,1:06:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 你主人是失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's face it…your master is a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.42,1:06:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.12,1:06:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.23,1:06:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾就是雷费高 雷费高就是艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einhorn is Finkle.Finkle is Einhorn!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.60,1:06:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾露丝是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einhorn is a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.54,1:07:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 艾露丝是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!Einhorn is a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.20,1:08:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的枪压住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your gun is digging into my hip."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.44,1:08:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.41,1:08:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次超级杯的头条是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the big story in this Super Bowl game is the abduction…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.04,1:08:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,海豚队的马理诺被俘虏\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Miami's starting quarterback, Dan Marino.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.45,1:08:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对该队一定构成影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be a strain on this Miami team, Bob…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.36,1:08:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？你不开心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Dan? Aren't you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.86,1:09:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱周日的超级杯 你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love Super Bowl Sunday. Don't you, Dan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.86,1:09:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个奇妙的下午…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A magical afternoon…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.63,1:09:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是梦想形成和粉碎的场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}where dreams are made and crushed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.71,1:09:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.71,1:09:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想找球票 找错地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want tickets, you're going about it the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.58,1:09:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看来面熟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look familiar to you? Does it seem as if we've…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.15,1:09:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否见过面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}met someplace before?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.12,1:09:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.22,1:09:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头部常受到撞击的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get hit in the head a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.22,1:09:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该丢钱了 开赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the coin toss.Kickoff time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.19,1:09:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最爱看开球的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,缝口向外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laces out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.85,1:10:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了些点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made some refreshments, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.23,1:10:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like some refreshments, Dan?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.96,1:10:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上便回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.09,1:10:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一吻可真野啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.03,1:10:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.96,1:10:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那疯妇给你多少 我付双倍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much psycho-woman's paying you, but I'll double it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.37,1:10:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 疯妇免我们坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry."Psycho-woman" keeps us out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.90,1:10:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowflake, here you go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.14,1:10:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我把球传给雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out, Marino.I'm throwing passes to a dolphin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.72,1:11:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,多拿点鱼来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get some more fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.22,1:11:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill that dolphin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.63,1:11:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好热闹的派对 可惜我没被邀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely party.Pity I wasn't invited.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.64,1:11:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,银鱼在何处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell's the smelt?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.49,1:11:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不省人事…一如我计划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unconscious. Exactly as I planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.33,1:11:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.81,1:12:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.82,1:12:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? What's going on?You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.75,1:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,午睡时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what?It's naptime!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟了 球被拦下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.33,1:12:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.73,1:12:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.07,1:12:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.34,1:12:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠物侦探王牌威龙…因特别任务而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace Ventura, Pet Detective. I've been sent with a special play:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.94,1:12:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放四分卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quarterback sneak.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.68,1:12:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,罚球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Penalty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.15,1:12:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,场中人数太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many men on the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.45,1:12:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已警告过你的 威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you, Ventura.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.15,1:12:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是王牌哥了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to "Ace"?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.09,1:12:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.39,1:12:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心用那电话 会死人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with that phone. In time, you could develop a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.46,1:12:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿瓜多 我是艾露丝队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aguado, it's Lieutenant Einhorn.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.10,1:13:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人来荷兰游艇会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send some men over to the Hallandale yacht basin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.14,1:13:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已把绑匪困在货仓内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the kidnapper trapped in the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.94,1:13:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是宠物侦探威龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ace Ventura, Pet Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.71,1:13:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拘捕绑匪行动进行中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 11 in progress, 343 Victorville Road at the Palmdale basin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.22,1:13:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警官需支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer needs backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.89,1:13:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,疑犯名叫威龙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspect's name: Ace Ventura…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.99,1:13:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有枪的危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be considered armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.59,1:13:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是威龙 我们快赶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ace. We gotta break out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.76,1:13:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.36,1:13:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我只知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, if there's one thing I know…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.77,1:13:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有不能应付的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing Ace can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.87,1:13:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.67,1:13:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.94,1:13:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓不会告诉任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never tell anyone, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.45,1:13:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的是他 杀他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's who you want! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.15,1:13:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 先杀他 - 杀他才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill him! - Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.02,1:13:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 持球的是他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He held the ball, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.85,1:13:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, look at him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.82,1:13:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该哭了 宝贝 - 小人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crybaby! - Jock! Wimp.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.22,1:13:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 白痴 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Musclehead. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.16,1:13:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会先杀那海豚 我不想你错过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll kill the dolphin first. I wouldn't want you to miss that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.40,1:14:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,射门了 一矢中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's the snap.The kick!And it's good!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.73,1:14:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好他没临门脚软\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see somebody who doesn't buckle under the pressure!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.61,1:14:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对压力有何认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you know about pressure?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.31,1:14:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吻过一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have kissed a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.05,1:14:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然超级杯历史上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, there's never been a more crucial kick in a.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.36,1:14:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比雷费高那次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super Bow lthan the "kick heard around the world."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.16,1:14:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,更令人印象深刻的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's clear to me that it was a good hold. Finkle just booted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.46,1:14:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时缝口向内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The laces were in!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.65,1:15:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.21,1:15:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付那女人有麻烦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a little trouble with the lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.94,1:15:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白 她不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand…she's a…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.88,1:15:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍他 露丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him, Lois! Get him!Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.93,1:15:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪射他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.10,1:15:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开枪！- 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shoot him! - Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.80,1:15:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.91,1:15:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 否则他没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns down, or this cop gets it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.24,1:15:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.14,1:15:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是说笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not joking!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.91,1:16:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷走了雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kidnapped Snowflake!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.25,1:16:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了普罗杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Roger Podacter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.05,1:16:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且企图杀马理诺和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was about to kill Marino and me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.86,1:16:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚构也是乐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiction can be fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.56,1:16:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我认为事实更有启发性\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I find the reference section much more enlightening.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.80,1:16:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,举例说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.33,1:16:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你翻查职业足球的百科全书\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you look up professional football's all-time bonehead plays…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.94,1:16:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最差的射门可能是雷费高\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might read about a Miami Dolphin kicker named Ray Finkle…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.34,1:16:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在十七届射失的那一球\N{\fnArial\fs30}who missed a 26-yard field goal in the closing seconds of Super Bowl 17.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.01,1:16:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不会知他后来进疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't read that Finkle was committed to a mental hospital…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.02,1:16:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃了出来 借失踪女人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to escape and join the police…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.95,1:16:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警界扶摇直上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a scheme to get even with Marino…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.59,1:16:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,并策划向马理诺报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom he blamed for the entire thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.76,1:16:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.46,1:16:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是艾露丝 是雷费高 是个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not Lois Einhorn! She's Ray Finkle! She's a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.97,1:16:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.40,1:16:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.84,1:17:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,且看是谁在说谎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see who's lying, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.24,1:17:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正女人会戴这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would a real woman have to wear one of these?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.32,1:17:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 原来是真发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that's really on there!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.86,1:17:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me this:
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.53,1:17:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的女人会没胸的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would a real woman be missing these?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.30,1:17:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这种手术只需数天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of surgery can be done over the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.67,1:17:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I doubt very much…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.07,1:17:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能否抽出时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he could find the time during his busy schedule…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.08,1:17:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去切除他的…子孙根\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get rid of big old…Mr. Knish!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.62,1:17:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.73,1:17:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,王牌 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.90,1:18:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse me for just one second?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.14,1:18:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我的同僚马理诺先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…my esteemed colleague, Mr. Marino…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.25,1:18:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了我新的启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought new evidence to my attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.45,1:18:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史证明 许多最能干的侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…history has certainly shown that even the most intuitive…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.39,1:18:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,中间也会出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}criminal investigator can be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.99,1:18:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果是我弄错了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I am mistaken…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.56,1:18:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果艾警长真的是女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the lieutenant is indeed a woman as she claims to be…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.17,1:18:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 她定是患了最大的痔疮\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, my friend…she is suffering from the worst case of hemorrhoids I have ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.77,1:18:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这便是普罗杰死的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Roger Podacter is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.08,1:18:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了「大棍」警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found Captain Winkie!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.19,1:18:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位晚安 你们是难得的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night!You've been a wonderful audience.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.99,1:18:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住给侍者付小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be sure to tip your waitress.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.80,1:19:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, animal boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.67,1:19:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当机立断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.82,1:19:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.60,1:19:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有口香糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any more gum?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.30,1:19:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你事 别管我的私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's none of your damn business. Stay out of my personal affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.21,1:19:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真了不起 真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a weird guy, Ace. A weird guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.48,1:19:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 海豚队深感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…the Miami Dolphins are proud…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.12,1:19:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可得回我们的吉祥物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to welcome back to Joe Robbie Stadium our beloved mascot…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.89,1:20:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,及半场的表现名星…雪花\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the star of our halftime show: Snowflake!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.97,1:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,及在下半场入场的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now returning for the second half, the Dolphins most valuable player…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.07,1:20:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐马理诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan Marino!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.45,1:21:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笨蛋 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Idiot! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.26,1:21:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你刚做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.62,1:21:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我损失了二万五千元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just cost me 25 grand, Polly.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.13,1:21:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Blow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.76,1:21:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.48,1:21:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,足总希望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The National Football League…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.22,1:21:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,致特别谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}would like to offer a special thank- you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.42,1:21:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,向救回马理诺及雪花的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the man who rescued Dan Marino…and our beloved Snowflake.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.56,1:21:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个伟大的人道主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great humanitarian…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.59,1:21:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个爱护动物的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lover of all animals:
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.79,1:21:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,神探王牌威龙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ace Ventura!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.50,1:21:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.44,1:22:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,东 穿上十三号 卖力演出吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tone, put that big-ass size 13 on and kick it for the homies.
